# The eager index chunk, one commit apart. Produced by:
#   npx vite build                                  (HEAD)
#   git checkout HEAD~1 -- src/ && npx vite build    (the commit before)
#   git checkout HEAD -- src/
# vite only, not npm run build: HEAD~1's src does not type-check against the
# new clearance files, which stay on disk because a path checkout does not
# delete them. They are unimported there, so they are not bundled either.

